      platform (https://clodex.xyz);
  (b) read and inspect the source code for security review, debugging, and
      educational study;
  (c) submit bug reports, issues, and pull requests to the official CLODEx
      repository; and
  (d) freely create, share, publish, and distribute user-generated content
      created with the Software (including .clodex-pack data presets, PNG
      Character Cards, screenshots, and recordings).

