      quota logic, or ES256 relic signature verification;
  (b) Competing Services & Commercial Exploitation: use, copy, adapt, or
      incorporate the Software (or any substantial part of its simulation
      core, UI, prompts, underworld/casino mechanics, gacha/skin systems, or
      bundler) to build, operate, promote, or support any competing AI API
      provider, proxy, reseller, key shop, paid extension, or commercial
      product;
  (c) Rebranding & Notice Removal: remove, obscure, or alter any CLODEx
      copyright notice, brand name, attribution, or this LICENSE file, or
      redistribute the Software under a different product name.

